from .core import source as S, trip as T
R='Europe'
S('ba-rivers','Bosnia and Herzegovina',R,'https://www.fishingbosnia.com/','Fishing Bosnia — Ribnik, Sana and Pliva','turn634483search18')
T('ba-rivers','Ribnik','Grayling;Brown trout','spring','clear-water fly presentation','Fishing Bosnia describes Ribnik fly fishing for grayling and brown trout.','Make presentation skill the central preparation task. Ask whether the session emphasizes dry flies or nymphs and request a short list of leader and fly sizes. A local lesson may add more value than a premium rod upgrade; choose a manageable wading day rather than assuming all clear water is shallow.')
T('ba-rivers','Pliva','Local targets to confirm','river','river-specific guided fly day','The guide service includes the Pliva among its named fishing rivers.','Ask why the Pliva is the proposed water for your date and experience level. Confirm the target, beat and daily transfer before using a neighboring river’s tackle list. The brief establishes a local guiding option but does not establish the same species or seasonal pattern at every river in the program.')
S('hr-river','Croatia',R,'https://balkan-fly-fishing.com/','River Life — Gacka and Kupa programs','turn634483search10')
T('hr-river','Gacka','Brown trout;Rainbow trout','spring','slow chalkstream trout','River Life describes the Gacka as a slow chalkstream with brown and rainbow trout.','Prepare to work on drift and approach rather than automatically selecting heavy nymphs. Ask for the guide’s presentation plan for clear, slow water and the actual bank access. Bring suitable existing trout equipment before adding specialized items to the shopping list.')
T('hr-river','Kupa / Gorski Kotar','Grayling;Trout','river','grayling and trout itinerary','River Life lists grayling and trout fishing in the Kupa system of Gorski Kotar.','Confirm which part of the system the guide will fish and whether changing water is part of the package. Choose the tackle after the guide separates the trout and grayling objectives. Do not count the whole multi-river area as one guaranteed day of access.')
T('hr-river','Kupica / Gorski Kotar','Grayling;Trout','river','smaller-water guided session','The operator includes the Kupica in its Gorski Kotar trout and grayling program.','Ask for a session specific to the Kupica instead of assuming the larger Kupa checklist applies unchanged. Discuss casting room and the planned leader setup, and consider supplied tackle for a short visit. Keep the meeting place and daily route attached to the saved plan.')
S('me-local','Montenegro',R,'https://www.musicarenje.net/','Montenegro Flyfishing Guide Service — local waters','turn634483search20')
T('me-local','Tara River','Brown trout;Grayling;Huchen','river','mountain-river fly-fishing','The guide lists brown trout, grayling and huchen on the Tara.','Make the primary species explicit: a trout or grayling day should not inherit a specialist huchen tackle list. Ask which stretch suits the party’s mobility and casting ability. Agree the footwear and daily walking before treating the canyon setting as a casual roadside outing.')
T('me-local','Biograd Lake','Brown trout','alpine','lake-based trout visit','The guide service describes brown-trout fishing at Biograd Lake.','Keep the lake visit distinct from a Tara river itinerary. Ask whether the proposed session is bank-based and what presentation is useful there. Plan the walking and return arrangements with the host rather than transporting a full river-wading system unnecessarily.')
S('me-lim','Montenegro',R,'https://flyfishingmontenegroguide.me/','Montenegro guide — River Lim','turn634483search21')
T('me-lim','Lim River','Grayling','river','grayling-oriented guided day','The local guide describes grayling fly fishing on the Lim.','Ask for a day built around grayling, including the stretch, presentation and walking distance. A shared regional guide may offer several rivers, so obtain the actual plan before booking accommodation. Use a focused trout-and-grayling outfit rather than unrelated coastal tackle.')
S('rs-drina','Serbia',R,'https://ivanflyguide.com/','Ivan Fly Guide — Serbian Drina fishing','turn634483search22')
T('rs-drina','Drina / Serbian bank','Local targets to confirm','river','tailwater fly-fishing plan','Ivan Fly Guide describes the Serbian Drina as a fly-fishing tailwater destination.','Confirm the exact bank and session with the guide, including how changing water conditions affect the plan. Do not substitute a general cross-border river overview for the actual meeting point. Ask for the target and leader system before deciding which outfit to pack.')
S('rs-danube','Serbia',R,'https://www.domovina.com/','Domovina — fishing at the Tisa–Danube confluence','turn634483search12')
T('rs-danube','Stari Slankamen / Tisa–Danube confluence','Local targets to confirm','riverboat','confluence boat-fishing discovery','The operator describes fishing near Stari Slankamen at the Tisa–Danube confluence.','Choose a guided boat session with a defined target and fishing area. A confluence is not a single easily interpreted bank spot for a visitor. Confirm what the captain supplies and whether your group wants an instructional outing or a full fishing day before comparing prices.')
S('cz-local','Czechia',R,'https://www.goflyfish.cz/','GoFlyFish — Šumava and the Otava','turn308353search0')
T('cz-local','Otava / Šumava','Local targets to confirm','river','guided nymphing and river skills','GoFlyFish describes guided fishing on the Otava in western Šumava.','Use the trip to develop the technique the host teaches, not simply to visit a famous river. Ask which stretch suits your experience and whether tackle is supplied. A short local fly list and instruction on presentation can be more valuable than buying a new outfit beforehand.')
S('cz-siman','Czechia',R,'https://shop.siman.cz/fly-fishing-trips-czech-republic.htm','Siman — Czech river guiding','turn308353search4')
T('cz-siman','Vltava','Local targets to confirm','river','Czech river instruction','Siman lists the Vltava among its guided Czech fly-fishing rivers.','Ask for a specific reach and contemporary guide availability; the page includes older guiding history. Decide whether the goal is instruction or exploration, then ask for a current tackle list. Do not turn an old professional biography into a promise of who will guide your booking.')
T('cz-siman','Jizera','Local targets to confirm','river','northeastern Bohemian fly day','The guide information identifies the Jizera among its Czech river options.','Confirm the current local host, reach and travel time before arranging the day. A national river list is not evidence that every guide covers every location. Ask which presentation and equipment will be used and prioritize a manageable session over an ambitious multi-river schedule.')
S('sk-local','Slovakia',R,'https://www.adventoura.eu/','Adventoura — Slovak guided fly-fishing waters','turn308353search1')
for place,angle,decision in [('Belá','wild-water guided session','Ask about the selected reach, current water conditions and alternatives before committing to a wading plan. Prioritize suitable footing and a manageable day over assumptions based on another Slovak river.'),('Váh','wide-river fly-fishing day','Ask whether the chosen presentation and casting distances suit your existing outfit. Clarify the bank and daily route; the broad river name does not define the fishing experience.'),('Poprad','urban river introduction','Build the day around a precise meeting point and a locally selected stretch. Ask about walking and access so the preparation remains appropriate to an urban river session rather than a remote mountain expedition.')]:
 T('sk-local',place,'Local targets to confirm','river',angle,f'Adventoura names the {place} as one of its guided Slovak fishing waters.',decision+' Confirm the primary species and included tackle before completing the shopping list.')
S('hu-carp','Hungary',R,'https://catchcarphungary.com/','Catch Carp Hungary — named lake programs','turn308353search13')
T('hu-carp','Lake Balaton','Carp','carp','multi-day carp base','The operator offers carp-fishing stays and tackle provision around Lake Balaton.','Compare the actual swim, accommodation and equipment package, not just the lake name. Ask how bait, landing equipment and rod transport are handled. A supplied-tackle package can remove bulky purchases, but the inclusions need to be confirmed item by item.')
T('hu-carp','Paradise Lake / Hungary','Carp','carp','chalet-based managed fishery','Catch Carp Hungary lists Paradise Lake as a carp venue with chalet accommodation.','Treat this as a managed-venue holiday rather than a wild-water expedition. Ask about swim allocation, shared space, bait and tackle hire before buying camping equipment. Check what non-angling guests can use so the group does not assume all facilities are included.')
T('hu-carp','Valley Lake / Hungary','Carp','carp','bivvy-based carp session','The operator describes Valley Lake as a carp venue with bivvy swims and variable depths.','Build the plan around the exact swim and overnight arrangement. Ask what shelter, bed, cooking and tackle equipment can be hired. Separate the fishing requirements from campsite comfort so the customer can see which large purchases are avoidable.')
S('ro-holbina','Romania',R,'https://www.discoverdanubedelta.com/','Discover Danube Delta — Holbina pike fishing','turn308353search7')
T('ro-holbina','Holbina / Danube Delta','Pike','lake','delta pike lodge visit','The operator identifies Holbina 3 Bibani as a pike-fishing location in the Danube Delta.','Compare the fishing boat, daily route and transfer to the lodge separately from a sightseeing cruise. Ask whether tackle and landing equipment are included. A dedicated pike plan should not inherit every species and technique listed for the entire delta.')
S('bg-guide','Bulgaria',R,'https://mankovflyfishing.com/','Mankov Fly Fishing — Bulgarian river programs','turn744255search0')
for p in ['Arda','Kanina','Iugovska']:
 T('bg-guide',p+' River','Local targets to confirm','river','Rhodope-region fly-fishing discovery',f'Mankov identifies the {p} among Bulgarian rivers suitable for fly-fishing trips.',f'Arrange the {p} outing with a specific local guide and target. Ask how travel time and river conditions affect the chosen stretch, and request the short fly and leader list for that session. Keep equipment purchases provisional until the intended water and method are confirmed.')
S('gr-crete','Greece',R,'https://seazetheday.gr/fishing-trips-in-chania-and-kissamos-learn-how-to-fish/','SEAze the Day — Chania and Kissamos fishing','turn513103search23')
T('gr-crete','Chania Bay / Crete','Grouper','reef','guided jigging and bottom fishing','SEAze the Day offers Chania-area jigging, spinning and bottom-fishing trips.','Ask which technique occupies most of the trip and whether the captain supplies tackle suited to it. Do not assume a sightseeing cruise includes serious fishing time. Choose a session duration the whole group can enjoy, and keep swimming or other activities explicit in the itinerary.')
T('gr-crete','Kissamos Bay / Crete','Dentex;Amberjack;Grouper','reef','targeted bay and reef charter','The operator lists Kissamos departures and dentex, grouper and amberjack in its local fishing description.','Compare a local bay session with a longer route beyond the bay. Ask the captain to confirm target, method and weather alternative. The useful equipment choice follows the actual presentation; a generic holiday rod may not match deep or structure-oriented fishing.')
S('cy-local','Cyprus','Asia','https://www.loveayianapa.com/','Love Ayia Napa — tuna-fishing departures','turn744255search14')
T('cy-local','Ayia Napa harbour','Tuna','offshore','season-dependent tuna outing','The local booking service advertises tuna-fishing departures from Ayia Napa harbour.','Request the tuna species, season for that program and current available date before reserving travel around it. Confirm whether the experience is private or shared and how rod time is allocated. Avoid buying heavy trolling equipment when the boat may already provide it.')
S('mt-listing','Malta',R,'https://fishingbooker.com/destinations/country/mt','Malta operator listings — Gozo and Kalkara','turn744255search11',kind='operator-listing')
T('mt-listing','Gozo offshore','Mahi-mahi;Local bottom fish','reef','deep bottom fishing with trolling transit','The Adele II listing describes deep fishing outside Gozo and lampuki trolling during transit.','Ask which activity is the main objective and what electric or conventional tackle is supplied. Do not interpret a trolling transit as a guaranteed pelagic day. Confirm departure, duration and the plan when sea conditions make the deeper grounds unsuitable.')
S('ch-oesch','Switzerland',R,'https://www.oeschinensee.ch/','Oeschinensee — official lake fishing information','turn513103search0',kind='destination-manager')
T('ch-oesch','Oeschinensee','Local targets to confirm','alpine','mountain-lake summer fishing','The official destination site describes summer fishing at Oeschinensee.','Coordinate the mountain access and fishing session rather than assuming the lake can be visited on any schedule. Ask about the actual shoreline, tackle and return arrangements. This summer plan does not establish safe winter ice access; that is a separate decision.')
S('ch-lungern','Switzerland',R,'https://www.obwalden-tourismus.ch/','Obwalden Tourism — Lake Lungern fishing','turn513103search18',kind='tourism-board')
T('ch-lungern','Lake Lungern','Rainbow trout;Brown trout;Perch','lake','Alpine-region lake selection','Obwalden Tourism describes Lungern fishing and lists trout and perch.','Choose a primary target and bank or boat plan with the local host. Do not infer the method from the scenery: a lake day differs from a steep mountain stream. Ask about tackle availability and the exact launch or shoreline before packing waders.')
S('ad-ordino','Andorra',R,'https://www.visitordino.com/','Visit Ordino — fishing at Tristaina','turn513103search19',kind='tourism-board')
T('ad-ordino','Tristaina lakes / Ordino','Local targets to confirm','alpine','Pyrenean fishing-and-hiking day','Visit Ordino names Tristaina among its mountain fishing locations.','Choose the actual lake and access route with a local source before treating the group of lakes as one fishery. Ask about the target, walking demands and useful tackle. Keep the pack compact and separate a scenic hike from confirmation of a fishable location.')
S('lt-guide','Lithuania',R,'https://balticseafishing.com/','Raimondas Venckus — Baltic and Curonian guiding','turn513103search13')
T('lt-guide','Curonian Lagoon / Lithuanian side','Pike;Perch;Zander','estuary','lagoon predator boat session','The guide offers Curonian Lagoon fishing for pike, perch and pikeperch.','Choose the primary predator and confirm a Lithuanian departure and fishing area. Ask which lure weights fit the planned water and what the boat supplies. Do not turn a lagoon profile into an unrestricted cross-border navigation plan.')
T('lt-guide','Lithuanian Baltic coast','Atlantic salmon','offshore','guided salmon trolling','The guide lists salmon trolling in the Baltic Sea.','Confirm the departure port, target window and amount of trolling equipment supplied. Treat this as an offshore boat plan rather than reusing the lagoon casting kit. Ask how weather decisions and replacement dates work before making the charter the only activity of a short visit.')
S('es-ebro','Spain',R,'https://caspe-fishing.com/','Caspe Fishing — Ebro catfish, carp and zander','turn308353search26')
T('es-ebro','River Ebro / Caspe','Wels catfish;Carp;Zander','riverboat','species-specific guided Ebro stay','Caspe Fishing offers guided Ebro trips for catfish, carp and zander with local accommodation.','Choose one primary fishing objective before comparing packages. A lure-focused zander day and a stationary carp or catfish session have different needs. Ask about boat use, bait and supplied tackle, then make the shopping list from the missing items rather than buying three incompatible setups.')
S('si-local','Slovenia',R,'https://alpsflyfish.com/','Alps Fly Fish — named Slovenian rivers','turn634483search5')
T('si-local','Idrijca','Marble trout','river','marble-trout river itinerary','The local operator describes marble trout in the Idrijca system.','Ask which reach and presentation are realistic for your experience and the planned date. Do not treat the presence of a trophy species as a likely daily outcome. Build the trip around fishing time, instruction and alternative presentations instead of a promised fish size.')
T('si-local','Unec','Grayling','spring','clear-stream presentation practice','The operator describes Unec grayling fly-fishing.','Ask about the selected reach and current water before copying the seasonal information from another Slovenian river. Focus the equipment list on the guide’s actual presentation choice. Retain the broad common name grayling here because the source’s more specific naming needs independent clarification.')
T('si-local','Krka','Brown trout;Rainbow trout;Huchen','river','choose trout or huchen before packing','The operator lists trout and Danube salmon, also called huchen, in its Krka fishing description.','Do not combine the equipment lists for a trout lesson and a specialist huchen outing. Select the main objective and ask what the operator regards as suitable experience, presentation and trip length. Any second target should be an agreed alternative, not an implied guarantee.')
